# Convex types are committed on purpose: `dist` builds on Vercel and other hosts
# run `tsc -b` on a fresh clone, and the Convex CLI can only regenerate these
# files with deploy credentials. `_generated/api.js` uses `anyApi`, so it stays
# valid as functions are added. Regenerate locally with `npx convex dev`.
# src/convex/_generated
.env.local
node_modules
dist
